{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01BwnWST86dbXi32EUHg3jxo","type":"tool_result","content":"     1→# Technical Plan: Production Checklist System\n     2→\n     3→**Version:** 1.2\n     4→**Date:** 2026-01-24\n     5→**Updated:** 2026-03-07\n     6→**Status:** Planning\n     7→**PRD:** [PRD-Production-Checklist-2026-01-24.md](./PRD-Production-Checklist-2026-01-24.md)\n     8→\n     9→---\n    10→\n    11→## Changelog (v1.2)\n    12→\n    13→- **CRITICAL FIX:** Corrected rundown segments path from `competitions/{compId}/rundown/segments` to `competitions/{compId}/rundown/segments` (matches RundownEditorPage)\n    14→- Added `lastUpdated` write to `toggleItem()` and `updateNote()` actions\n    15→- Fixed optimistic update race condition — use functional state updates\n    16→- Added fix link for `socket-connected` (→ `/_admin/vm-pool`)\n    17→- Added fix link for `obs-connected` to items definition consistency\n    18→- Added error boundary requirement for ChecklistPage\n    19→- Added Firebase security rules note (Section 8.4)\n    20→- Clarified contact auto-validation is \"auto-assist\" — overrides manual items display, doesn't change type\n    21→- Added sidebar collapse behavior for Day Of phases\n    22→- Added `meetTheme` validator (new auto-validated item, total now 14)\n    23→- Added notes on headshot threshold rationale and timezone-awareness\n    24→\n    25→### v1.1 (2026-03-06)\n    26→\n    27→- Updated validators to support N teams dynamically based on competition type\n    28→- Removed `checkedBy` from data model\n    29→- Fixed \"Fix\" link paths\n    30→- Updated component hierarchy to handle N teams in contacts panel\n    31→- Added `react-hot-toast` as dependency for toast notifications\n    32→- Specified VM health check approach (use `checkVmStatus()` utility function)\n    33→- Updated item count from 72 to 74\n    34→- Updated phase tab labels\n    35→- Added ProducerView sidebar link to integration points\n    36→- Added `teamCount` helper from `competitionUtils.js`\n    37→- Specified that `buildTeamKey()` is used for contacts team key derivation\n    38→\n    39→---\n    40→\n    41→## Related Documents\n    42→\n    43→| Document | Purpose |\n    44→|----------|---------|\n    45→| [PRD-Production-Checklist-2026-01-24.md](./PRD-Production-Checklist-2026-01-24.md) | Product requirements |\n    46→| [PLAN-Production-Checklist-Implementation.md](./PLAN-Production-Checklist-Implementation.md) | Task breakdown and progress tracking |\n    47→| [checklist-items-definition.md](./checklist-items-definition.md) | Complete list of all 74 checklist items |\n    48→\n    49→---\n    50→\n    51→## 1. Architecture Overview\n    52→\n    53→### 1.1 System Components\n    54→\n    55→```\n    56→CHECKLIST SYSTEM\n    57→════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n    58→\n    59→┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n    60→│  ChecklistPage.jsx                                          │\n    61→│  ├── Phase tabs (Setup, Pre-Prod, 2hr Before, 1hr Before)  │\n    62→│  ├── Progress bar                                           │\n    63→│  ├── Category sections (collapsible)                        │\n    64→│  ├── Auto-validated items (read system state)               │\n    65→│  ├── Manual items (checkboxes)                              │\n    66→│  └── TeamContactsPanel (N teams)                            │\n    67→└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n    68→                              │\n    69→                              ▼\n    70→┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n    71→│  useProductionChecklist.js (Hook)                           │\n    72→│  ├── Subscribe to Firebase checklist state                  │\n    73→│  ├── Subscribe to competitions/{compId}/rundown/segments              │\n    74→│  ├── Compute auto-validated items (13 validators)           │\n    75→│  ├── toggleItem(itemId) → optimistic update + rollback     │\n    76→│  ├── addNote(itemId, note) → Firebase write                │\n    77→│  ├── VM status polling via checkVmStatus() utility         │\n    78→│  └── Calculate progress stats                               │\n    79→└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n    80→                              │\n    81→               ┌──────────────┼──────────────┐\n    82→               ▼              ▼              ▼\n    83→┌─────────────────┐ ┌─────────────────┐ ┌─────────────────┐\n    84→│ CompetitionCtx  │ │ ShowContext     │ │ OBSContext      │\n    85→│ (config, teams) │ │ (connected)     │ │ (obsConnected)  │\n    86→└─────────────────┘ └─────────────────┘ └─────────────────┘\n    87→```\n    88→\n    89→**Note:** ShowContext and OBSContext are only available inside CompetitionLayout routes. The checklist page MUST be inside the `/:compId` route group (which it is).\n    90→\n    91→### 1.2 Data Flow\n    92→\n    93→```\n    94→┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n    95→│  SOURCES (Read-Only)                                                         │\n    96→│                                                                              │\n    97→│  CompetitionContext          Firebase                    Contexts            │\n    98→│  └── competitionConfig       └── teamData               └── ShowContext     │\n    99→│      └── eventName               └── roster                 └── connected   │\n   100→│      └── meetDate                └── headshots          └── OBSContext      │\n   101→│      └── venue               └── production/rundown/        └── obsConnected│\n   102→│      └── team{1-7}Name              segments/ (editor fmt)                  │\n   103→│      └── team{1-7}Logo      └── teamsDatabase/contacts                     │\n   104→│      └── vmAddress                                                          │\n   105→│      └── compType                                                           │\n   106→└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n   107→                                       │\n   108→                                       │ Compute at runtime\n   109→                                       ▼\n   110→┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n   111→│  CHECKLIST STATE                                                             │\n   112→│                                                                              │\n   113→│  {                                                                           │\n   114→│    phases: [                                                                 │\n   115→│      {                                                                       │\n   116→│        id: \"setup\",                                                          │\n   117→│        name: \"Setup\",                                                        │\n   118→│        shortName: \"Setup\",                                                   │\n   119→│        categories: [                                                         │\n   120→│          {                                                                   │\n   121→│            id: \"competition-config\",                                         │\n   122→│            name: \"Competition Config\",                                       │\n   123→│            items: [                                                          │\n   124→│              { id: \"event-name\", name: \"Event name configured\",              │\n   125→│                autoValidate: true, status: \"complete\", detail: \"WCU vs W&M\" }│\n   126→│              { id: \"session-created\", name: \"Session created in Virtius\",   │\n   127→│                autoValidate: false, status: \"pending\", checked: false }      │\n   128→│            ]                                                                 │\n   129→│          }                                                                   │\n   130→│        ]                                                                     │\n   131→│      }                                                                       │\n   132→│    ],                                                                        │\n   133→│    summary: { total: 74, complete: 45, warnings: 5, errors: 3 }             │\n   134→│  }                                                                           │\n   135→└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n   136→                                       │\n   137→                                       │ Write (manual items only)\n   138→                                       ▼\n   139→┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n   140→│  FIREBASE: competitions/{compId}/checklist                                   │\n   141→│                                                                              │\n   142→│  {                                                                           │\n   143→│    items: {                                                                  │\n   144→│      \"session-created\": { checked: true, checkedAt: \"...\" }                 │\n   145→│      \"pre-meet-email\": { checked: true, checkedAt: \"...\" }                  │\n   146→│    },                                                                        │\n   147→│    notes: {                                                                  │\n   148→│      \"camera-op-contact\": \"John Smith - 610-555-1234\"                       │\n   149→│    },                                                                        │\n   150→│    lastUpdated: \"2026-01-24T12:00:00Z\"                                      │\n   151→│  }                                                                           │\n   152→└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n   153→```\n   154→\n   155→---\n   156→\n   157→## 2. Firebase Data Models\n   158→\n   159→### 2.1 Checklist State (Per Competition)\n   160→\n   161→**Path:** `competitions/{compId}/checklist`\n   162→\n   163→```javascript\n   164→{\n   165→  // Manual item states (auto items computed at runtime)\n   166→  items: {\n   167→    \"session-created\": {\n   168→      checked: true,\n   169→      checkedAt: \"2026-01-24T10:00:00Z\"\n   170→    },\n   171→    \"pre-meet-email\": {\n   172→      checked: true,\n   173→      checkedAt: \"2026-01-24T11:00:00Z\"\n   174→    }\n   175→    // absent = unchecked\n   176→  },\n   177→\n   178→  // Notes per item (optional)\n   179→  notes: {\n   180→    \"camera-op-contact\": \"John Smith - 610-555-1234\",\n   181→    \"equipment-check\": \"Backup battery in camera bag\"\n   182→  },\n   183→\n   184→  lastUpdated: \"2026-01-24T12:00:00Z\"\n   185→}\n   186→```\n   187→\n   188→### 2.2 Team Contacts Database\n   189→\n   190→**Path:** `teamsDatabase/contacts/{team-key}`\n   191→\n   192→Team keys are derived via `buildTeamKey(school, gender)` from `show-controller/src/lib/competitionUtils.js`. Example: `buildTeamKey(\"West Chester\", \"womens\")` → `\"west-chester-womens\"`.\n   193→\n   194→```javascript\n   195→// Example: teamsDatabase/contacts/west-chester-womens\n   196→{\n   197→  \"head-coach\": {\n   198→    name: \"Jane Smith\",\n   199→    role: \"Head Coach\",\n   200→    email: \"jsmith@wcupa.edu\",\n   201→    phone: \"610-555-1234\",\n   202→    preferredContact: \"email\",  // \"email\" | \"phone\" | \"text\"\n   203→    notes: \"Best reached before 3pm\",\n   204→    updatedAt: \"2026-01-24T10:00:00Z\"\n   205→  },\n   206→\n   207→  \"assistant-coach\": {\n   208→    name: \"Bob Johnson\",\n   209→    role: \"Assistant Coach\",\n   210→    email: \"bjohnson@wcupa.edu\",\n   211→    phone: \"610-555-5678\",\n   212→    updatedAt: \"2026-01-24T10:00:00Z\"\n   213→  },\n   214→\n   215→  \"sid\": {\n   216→    name: \"Media Person\",\n   217→    role: \"Sports Information Director\",\n   218→    email: \"media@wcupa.edu\",\n   219→    phone: \"610-555-9012\",\n   220→    updatedAt: \"2026-01-24T10:00:00Z\"\n   221→  },\n   222→\n   223→  \"camera-op-primary\": {\n   224→    name: \"Camera Person\",\n   225→    role: \"Camera Operator\",\n   226→    phone: \"610-555-3456\",\n   227→    notes: \"Student worker, available weekends\",\n   228→    updatedAt: \"2026-01-24T10:00:00Z\"\n   229→  },\n   230→\n   231→  \"camera-op-backup\": {\n   232→    name: \"Backup Person\",\n   233→    role: \"Camera Operator (Backup)\",\n   234→    phone: \"610-555-7890\",\n   235→    updatedAt: \"2026-01-24T10:00:00Z\"\n   236→  },\n   237→\n   238→  \"venue-operations\": {\n   239→    name: \"Facility Manager\",\n   240→    role: \"Venue Operations\",\n   241→    email: \"facilities@wcupa.edu\",\n   242→    phone: \"610-555-2222\",\n   243→    notes: \"Contact for A/V access, power, wifi credentials\",\n   244→    updatedAt: \"2026-01-24T10:00:00Z\"\n   245→  },\n   246→\n   247→  \"scoring-operations\": {\n   248→    name: \"Meet Director\",\n   249→    role: \"Scoring Operations\",\n   250→    email: \"meetdirector@wcupa.edu\",\n   251→    phone: \"610-555-3333\",\n   252→    notes: \"Scoring table contact, lineup changes\",\n   253→    updatedAt: \"2026-01-24T10:00:00Z\"\n   254→  }\n   255→}\n   256→```\n   257→\n   258→### 2.3 Site Evaluations Database (Future - Phase 3)\n   259→\n   260→**Path:** `teamsDatabase/venues/{venue-key}`\n   261→\n   262→*(Unchanged from v1.0 — see original plan for full schema)*\n   263→\n   264→### 2.4 Checklist Templates (Future - Phase 2)\n   265→\n   266→**Path:** `checklistTemplates/{template-id}`\n   267→\n   268→*(Unchanged from v1.0 — see original plan for full schema)*\n   269→\n   270→---\n   271→\n   272→## 3. Component Architecture\n   273→\n   274→### 3.1 File Structure\n   275→\n   276→```\n   277→show-controller/src/\n   278→├── pages/\n   279→│   └── ChecklistPage.jsx           # Main checklist page\n   280→├── components/\n   281→│   ├── checklist/\n   282→│   │   ├── ChecklistPhaseTab.jsx   # Phase tab navigation\n   283→│   │   ├── ChecklistCategory.jsx   # Collapsible category section\n   284→│   │   ├── ChecklistItem.jsx       # Individual checklist item\n   285→│   │   └── ChecklistProgress.jsx   # Progress bar component\n   286→│   └── TeamContactsPanel.jsx       # Contacts management panel\n   287→├── hooks/\n   288→│   └── useProductionChecklist.js   # Main checklist hook\n   289→└── lib/\n   290→    ├── checklistItems.js           # Hardcoded checklist definition (74 items)\n   291→    └── checklistValidators.js      # Auto-validation functions (13 validators)\n   292→```\n   293→\n   294→### 3.2 Component Hierarchy\n   295→\n   296→```jsx\n   297→<ChecklistPage>\n   298→  <CompetitionHeader />  // Existing component\n   299→\n   300→  <div className=\"checklist-container\">\n   301→    {/* Progress Section */}\n   302→    <ChecklistProgress\n   303→      total={74}\n   304→      complete={45}\n   305→      warnings={5}\n   306→      errors={3}\n   307→    />\n   308→\n   309→    {/* Phase Tabs */}\n   310→    <ChecklistPhaseTab\n   311→      phases={phases}\n   312→      activePhase={activePhase}\n   313→      onPhaseChange={setActivePhase}\n   314→    />\n   315→\n   316→    <div className=\"checklist-content\">\n   317→      {/* Main Checklist */}\n   318→      <div className=\"checklist-main\">\n   319→        {activePhase.categories.map(category => (\n   320→          <ChecklistCategory\n   321→            key={category.id}\n   322→            category={category}\n   323→            expanded={expandedCategories.has(category.id)}\n   324→            onToggle={() => toggleCategory(category.id)}\n   325→            onItemToggle={toggleItem}\n   326→            onNoteChange={updateNote}\n   327→          />\n   328→        ))}\n   329→      </div>\n   330→\n   331→      {/* Sidebar: Team Contacts */}\n   332→      <div className=\"checklist-sidebar\">\n   333→        <TeamContactsPanel\n   334→          teams={teamKeys}  // Dynamic: derived from comp type (1-7 teams)\n   335→          contacts={contacts}\n   336→          onContactUpdate={updateContact}\n   337→        />\n   338→      </div>\n   339→    </div>\n   340→  </div>\n   341→</ChecklistPage>\n   342→```\n   343→\n   344→**Team keys derivation:**\n   345→```javascript\n   346→// In ChecklistPage or useProductionChecklist\n   347→import { getTeamCount } from '../lib/competitionUtils';\n   348→import { buildTeamKey } from '../lib/competitionUtils';\n   349→\n   350→const teamCount = getTeamCount(competitionConfig.compType);\n   351→const teamKeys = [];\n   352→for (let i = 1; i <= teamCount; i++) {\n   353→  const name = competitionConfig[`team${i}Name`];\n   354→  if (name) {\n   355→    teamKeys.push(buildTeamKey(name, gender));\n   356→  }\n   357→}\n   358→```\n   359→\n   360→### 3.3 Hook Interface\n   361→\n   362→```javascript\n   363→// useProductionChecklist.js\n   364→\n   365→import { checkVmStatus } from './useCompetitions'; // standalone async function\n   366→import { db, ref, onValue, set } from '../lib/firebase';\n   367→import toast from 'react-hot-toast';\n   368→\n   369→export function useProductionChecklist() {\n   370→  const { compId, competitionConfig } = useCompetition();\n   371→  const { connected: socketConnected } = useShow();\n   372→  const { obsConnected } = useOBS();\n   373→\n   374→  // State\n   375→  const [checklistState, setChecklistState] = useState(null);\n   376→  const [localChecklistState, setLocalChecklistState] = useState(null); // for optimistic updates\n   377→  const [teamData, setTeamData] = useState(null);\n   378→  const [rundownSegments, setRundownSegments] = useState([]);\n   379→  const [contacts, setContacts] = useState({});\n   380→  const [vmStatus, setVmStatus] = useState({ online: false, checking: true });\n   381→  const [loading, setLoading] = useState(true);\n   382→\n   383→  // Subscribe to rundown segments\n   384→  // IMPORTANT: Path is competitions/{compId}/rundown/segments (NOT production/rundown/segments)\n   385→  // The production/rundown/ path is only used for analytics\n   386→  useEffect(() => {\n   387→    const segmentsRef = ref(db, `competitions/${compId}/rundown/segments`);\n   388→    const unsub = onValue(segmentsRef, (snap) => {\n   389→      const data = snap.val();\n   390→      setRundownSegments(data ? Object.values(data) : []);\n   391→    });\n   392→    return () => unsub();\n   393→  }, [compId]);\n   394→\n   395→  // VM status polling (30s interval) using standalone utility\n   396→  useEffect(() => {\n   397→    if (!competitionConfig?.vmAddress) {\n   398→      setVmStatus({ online: false, checking: false });\n   399→      return;\n   400→    }\n   401→    const poll = async () => {\n   402→      setVmStatus(prev => ({ ...prev, checking: true }));\n   403→      const result = await checkVmStatus(competitionConfig.vmAddress);\n   404→      setVmStatus({ online: result.online, checking: false, error: result.error });\n   405→    };\n   406→    poll();\n   407→    const interval = setInterval(poll, 30000);\n   408→    return () => clearInterval(interval);\n   409→  }, [competitionConfig?.vmAddress]);\n   410→\n   411→  // Computed checklist items\n   412→  const checklistItems = useMemo(() => {\n   413→    return computeChecklistItems({\n   414→      competitionConfig,\n   415→      teamData,\n   416→      rundownSegments,\n   417→      checklistState: localChecklistState || checklistState,\n   418→      socketConnected,\n   419→      obsConnected,\n   420→      vmStatus,\n   421→      contacts\n   422→    });\n   423→  }, [/* deps */]);\n   424→\n   425→  // Summary stats\n   426→  const summary = useMemo(() => ({\n   427→    total: countAllItems(checklistItems),\n   428→    complete: countComplete(checklistItems),\n   429→    warnings: countWarnings(checklistItems),\n   430→    errors: countErrors(checklistItems),\n   431→    percentage: calculatePercentage(checklistItems)\n   432→  }), [checklistItems]);\n   433→\n   434→  // Actions - optimistic toggle with rollback\n   435→  // NOTE: Uses functional state update to avoid race condition when toggling\n   436→  // multiple items quickly. Reads previousState from localChecklistState (not\n   437→  // Firebase state) so rapid toggles don't clobber each other.\n   438→  const toggleItem = useCallback(async (itemId) => {\n   439→    let previousState;\n   440→    const now = new Date().toISOString();\n   441→\n   442→    // Optimistic update — use functional form to safely read current local state\n   443→    setLocalChecklistState(prev => {\n   444→      previousState = prev?.items?.[itemId]?.checked\n   445→        ?? checklistState?.items?.[itemId]?.checked\n   446→        ?? false;\n   447→      return {\n   448→        ...prev,\n   449→        items: { ...(prev?.items || {}), [itemId]: { checked: !previousState, checkedAt: now } }\n   450→      };\n   451→    });\n   452→\n   453→    try {\n   454→      await set(ref(db, `competitions/${compId}/checklist/items/${itemId}`), {\n   455→        checked: !previousState,\n   456→        checkedAt: now\n   457→      });\n   458→      // Update lastUpdated timestamp\n   459→      await set(ref(db, `competitions/${compId}/checklist/lastUpdated`), now);\n   460→    } catch (error) {\n   461→      // Rollback on failure — only revert this specific item\n   462→      setLocalChecklistState(prev => ({\n   463→        ...prev,\n   464→        items: { ...(prev?.items || {}), [itemId]: { checked: previousState } }\n   465→      }));\n   466→      toast.error('Failed to update checklist item');\n   467→    }\n   468→  }, [compId, checklistState]);\n   469→\n   470→  const updateNote = useCallback(async (itemId, note) => {\n   471→    try {\n   472→      const now = new Date().toISOString();\n   473→      await set(ref(db, `competitions/${compId}/checklist/notes/${itemId}`), note);\n   474→      await set(ref(db, `competitions/${compId}/checklist/lastUpdated`), now);\n   475→    } catch (error) {\n   476→      toast.error('Failed to save note');\n   477→    }\n   478→  }, [compId]);\n   479→\n   480→  const updateContact = useCallback(async (teamKey, contactId, contactData) => {\n   481→    try {\n   482→      await set(ref(db, `teamsDatabase/contacts/${teamKey}/${contactId}`), {\n   483→        ...contactData,\n   484→        updatedAt: new Date().toISOString()\n   485→      });\n   486→      toast.success('Contact saved');\n   487→    } catch (error) {\n   488→      toast.error('Failed to save contact');\n   489→    }\n   490→  }, []);\n   491→\n   492→  return {\n   493→    checklistItems,\n   494→    summary,\n   495→    contacts,\n   496→    toggleItem,\n   497→    updateNote,\n   498→    updateContact,\n   499→    loading,\n   500→    refresh: () => { /* trigger re-fetch */ }\n   501→  };\n   502→}\n   503→```\n   504→\n   505→---\n   506→\n   507→## 4. Auto-Validation Logic\n   508→\n   509→### 4.1 Validation Functions\n   510→\n   511→```javascript\n   512→// lib/checklistValidators.js\n   513→\n   514→import { getTeamCount } from './competitionUtils';\n   515→\n   516→/**\n   517→ * Helper: get team count from competition config\n   518→ */\n   519→function getTeamCountFromConfig(config) {\n   520→  if (!config?.compType) return 2;\n   521→  return getTeamCount(config.compType);\n   522→}\n   523→\n   524→export const validators = {\n   525→  // Competition Config\n   526→  'event-name': (ctx) => ({\n   527→    status: ctx.config?.eventName ? 'complete' : 'error',\n   528→    detail: ctx.config?.eventName || 'Not set'\n   529→  }),\n   530→\n   531→  'meet-date': (ctx) => ({\n   532→    status: ctx.config?.meetDate ? 'complete' : 'error',\n   533→    detail: ctx.config?.meetDate || 'Not set'\n   534→  }),\n   535→\n   536→  'venue-configured': (ctx) => ({\n   537→    status: ctx.config?.venue ? 'complete' : 'error',\n   538→    detail: ctx.config?.venue || 'Not set'\n   539→  }),\n   540→\n   541→  'teams-configured': (ctx) => {\n   542→    const teamCount = getTeamCountFromConfig(ctx.config);\n   543→    const results = [];\n   544→    let allOk = true;\n   545→    for (let i = 1; i <= teamCount; i++) {\n   546→      const nameOk = !!ctx.config?.[`team${i}Name`];\n   547→      const logoOk = !!ctx.config?.[`team${i}Logo`];\n   548→      const ok = nameOk && logoOk;\n   549→      if (!ok) allOk = false;\n   550→      results.push(`Team ${i}: ${ok ? '✓' : '✗'}`);\n   551→    }\n   552→    return {\n   553→      status: allOk ? 'complete' : 'error',\n   554→      detail: results.join(', ')\n   555→    };\n   556→  },\n   557→\n   558→  // Team Data (dynamic N teams)\n   559→  'rosters-loaded': (ctx) => {\n   560→    const teamCount = getTeamCountFromConfig(ctx.config);\n   561→    const results = [];\n   562→    let allOk = true;\n   563→    for (let i = 1; i <= teamCount; i++) {\n   564→      const count = ctx.teamData?.[`team${i}`]?.roster?.length || 0;\n   565→      if (count === 0) allOk = false;\n   566→      results.push(`Team ${i}: ${count}`);\n   567→    }\n   568→    return {\n   569→      status: allOk ? 'complete' : 'warning',\n   570→      detail: results.join(', ')\n   571→    };\n   572→  },\n   573→\n   574→  'headshots-uploaded': (ctx) => {\n   575→    // Threshold rationale: 80% accounts for walk-ons and injured athletes who\n   576→    // won't compete and may not have headshots. Only ~6 of ~20 roster members\n   577→    // typically compete, so 80% of the full roster is a reasonable floor.\n   578→    // A per-lineup check would be more accurate but lineups aren't available\n   579→    // until day-of (Phase 3), so we use roster-wide percentage in Setup phase.\n   580→    const teamCount = getTeamCountFromConfig(ctx.config);\n   581→    const getHeadshotPercent = (roster) => {\n   582→      if (!roster?.length) return 0;\n   583→      const withPhotos = roster.filter(a => a.headshotUrl).length;\n   584→      return Math.round((withPhotos / roster.length) * 100);\n   585→    };\n   586→    let totalPct = 0;\n   587→    const results = [];\n   588→    for (let i = 1; i <= teamCount; i++) {\n   589→      const pct = getHeadshotPercent(ctx.teamData?.[`team${i}`]?.roster);\n   590→      totalPct += pct;\n   591→      results.push(`T${i}: ${pct}%`);\n   592→    }\n   593→    const avgPct = Math.round(totalPct / teamCount);\n   594→    return {\n   595→      status: avgPct >= 80 ? 'complete' : avgPct >= 50 ? 'warning' : 'error',\n   596→      detail: results.join(', ')\n   597→    };\n   598→  },\n   599→\n   600→  // Meet Theme\n   601→  'theme-configured': (ctx) => ({\n   602→    status: ctx.config?.meetTheme ? 'complete' : 'warning',\n   603→    detail: ctx.config?.meetTheme || 'No theme set (using defaults)'\n   604→  }),\n   605→\n   606→  // Infrastructure\n   607→  'vm-assigned': (ctx) => ({\n   608→    status: ctx.config?.vmAddress ? 'complete' : 'error',\n   609→    detail: ctx.config?.vmAddress || 'No VM assigned'\n   610→  }),\n   611→\n   612→  'vm-online': (ctx) => ({\n   613→    status: ctx.vmStatus?.checking ? 'checking'\n   614→      : ctx.vmStatus?.online ? 'complete'\n   615→      : 'error',\n   616→    detail: ctx.vmStatus?.checking ? 'Checking...'\n   617→      : ctx.vmStatus?.online ? 'Online'\n   618→      : ctx.vmStatus?.error || 'Offline'\n   619→  }),\n   620→\n   621→  'socket-connected': (ctx) => ({\n   622→    status: ctx.socketConnected ? 'complete' : 'error',\n   623→    detail: ctx.socketConnected ? 'Connected' : 'Disconnected'\n   624→  }),\n   625→\n   626→  'obs-connected': (ctx) => ({\n   627→    status: ctx.obsConnected ? 'complete' : 'error',\n   628→    detail: ctx.obsConnected ? 'Connected' : 'Not connected'\n   629→  }),\n   630→\n   631→  // Rundown (uses EDITOR format at competitions/{compId}/rundown/segments)\n   632→  'rundown-created': (ctx) => ({\n   633→    status: ctx.rundownSegments?.length > 0 ? 'complete' : 'error',\n   634→    detail: ctx.rundownSegments?.length\n   635→      ? `${ctx.rundownSegments.length} segments`\n   636→      : 'No segments'\n   637→  }),\n   638→\n   639→  'segments-named': (ctx) => {\n   640→    if (!ctx.rundownSegments?.length) return { status: 'error', detail: 'No segments' };\n   641→    const unnamed = ctx.rundownSegments.filter(\n   642→      s => !s.name || s.name === 'New Segment'\n   643→    ).length;\n   644→    return {\n   645→      status: unnamed === 0 ? 'complete' : 'warning',\n   646→      detail: unnamed === 0 ? 'All named' : `${unnamed} unnamed`\n   647→    };\n   648→  },\n   649→\n   650→  'graphics-assigned': (ctx) => {\n   651→    const total = ctx.rundownSegments?.length || 0;\n   652→    if (total === 0) return { status: 'error', detail: 'No segments' };\n   653→    const withGraphics = ctx.rundownSegments.filter(\n   654→      s => s.graphic?.graphicId\n   655→    ).length;\n   656→    const pct = Math.round((withGraphics / total) * 100);\n   657→    return {\n   658→      status: pct >= 80 ? 'complete' : pct >= 50 ? 'warning' : 'error',\n   659→      detail: `${withGraphics}/${total} (${pct}%)`\n   660→    };\n   661→  }\n   662→};\n   663→```\n   664→\n   665→---\n   666→\n   667→## 5. UI Patterns\n   668→\n   669→### 5.1 Color Scheme (Matches Existing)\n   670→\n   671→```css\n   672→/* Status Colors */\n   673→--complete: #22c55e;    /* green-500 */\n   674→--warning: #f59e0b;     /* amber-500 */\n   675→--error: #ef4444;       /* red-500 */\n   676→--pending: #71717a;     /* zinc-500 */\n   677→--checking: #71717a;    /* zinc-500 with animation */\n   678→\n   679→/* Backgrounds */\n   680→--bg-primary: #18181b;  /* zinc-900 */\n   681→--bg-secondary: #27272a; /* zinc-800 */\n   682→--bg-tertiary: #3f3f46; /* zinc-700 */\n   683→\n   684→/* Text */\n   685→--text-primary: #ffffff;\n   686→--text-secondary: #a1a1aa; /* zinc-400 */\n   687→--text-muted: #71717a;    /* zinc-500 */\n   688→```\n   689→\n   690→### 5.2 Item States\n   691→\n   692→| State | Icon | Color | Description |\n   693→|-------|------|-------|-------------|\n   694→| Complete | ✓ CheckCircle | green | Requirement met |\n   695→| Warning | ⚠ ExclamationTriangle | amber | Partial/suboptimal |\n   696→| Error | ✗ XCircle | red | Requirement not met |\n   697→| Pending | ○ Circle | zinc | Manual item, not checked |\n   698→| Checking | ↻ ArrowPath (spin) | zinc | Async validation in progress |\n   699→\n   700→### 5.3 Progress Bar\n   701→\n   702→```\n   703→████████████░░░░░░░░  61% Complete (45/74)\n   704→\n   705→[■ 45 complete] [▲ 5 warnings] [● 3 errors] [○ 21 pending]\n   706→```\n   707→\n   708→### 5.4 Toast Notifications\n   709→\n   710→**Dependency:** `react-hot-toast`\n   711→\n   712→```javascript\n   713→import toast from 'react-hot-toast';\n   714→\n   715→// Usage\n   716→toast.success('Contact saved');\n   717→toast.error('Failed to update checklist item');\n   718→```\n   719→\n   720→Add `<Toaster />` component to App.jsx (one-time setup).\n   721→\n   722→---\n   723→\n   724→## 6. Route Configuration\n   725→\n   726→```jsx\n   727→// App.jsx - Add inside competition-bound routes\n   728→\n   729→<Route path=\"/:compId\" element={<CompetitionLayout />}>\n   730→  {/* Existing routes */}\n   731→  <Route index element={<Navigate to=\"producer\" replace />} />\n   732→  <Route path=\"producer\" element={<ProducerView />} />\n   733→  <Route path=\"talent\" element={<TalentView />} />\n   734→  <Route path=\"rundown\" element={<RundownEditorPage />} />\n   735→\n   736→  {/* New checklist route */}\n   737→  <Route path=\"checklist\" element={<ChecklistPage />} />\n   738→</Route>\n   739→```\n   740→\n   741→**URL Pattern:** `/{compId}/checklist`\n   742→\n   743→---\n   744→\n   745→## 7. Integration Points\n   746→\n   747→### 7.1 Navigation Links\n   748→\n   749→Add checklist link to:\n   750→- **HomePage** competition cards (new \"Checklist\" button alongside \"Producer\", \"Talent\", etc.)\n   751→- **CompetitionHeader** (ClipboardDocumentCheckIcon link)\n   752→- **ProducerView** sidebar (prominent link — this is where producers spend most time)\n   753→\n   754→### 7.2 Contact Auto-Assist (Not Auto-Validation)\n   755→\n   756→Certain manual checklist items can be **auto-assisted** by contact data. These items remain `type: manual` but display a visual indicator when the system detects the related contact exists. The producer can still uncheck them (e.g., if the contact info is stale).\n   757→\n   758→**This is NOT auto-validation** — the item type stays `manual`, the checkbox stays interactive, and it doesn't count toward the 14 auto-validated items. It's a convenience hint.\n   759→\n   760→| Contact Exists | Checklist Item Affected | Behavior |\n   761→|----------------|------------------------|----------|\n   762→| `camera-op-primary` | `camera-op-contact` (#11) | Show \"auto-checked\" hint; producer can uncheck |\n   763→| `head-coach` with email | `talent-contacted` (#12) | Show info icon with contact details |\n   764→\n   765→### 7.3 Fix Links\n   766→\n   767→Each auto-validated item can have a `fixLink` pointing to the page where it can be resolved:\n   768→\n   769→| Item | Fix Link | Notes |\n   770→|------|----------|-------|\n   771→| Event name | `/` | HomePage — click Edit on competition |\n   772→| Meet date | `/` | HomePage — click Edit on competition |\n   773→| Venue | `/` | HomePage — click Edit on competition |\n   774→| Teams configured | `/` | HomePage — click Edit on competition |\n   775→| Theme configured | `/themes` | Theme editor page |\n   776→| Rosters/Headshots | `/media-manager` | |\n   777→| VM assigned | `/_admin/vm-pool` | |\n   778→| VM online | `/_admin/vm-pool` | Start VM from pool page |\n   779→| Socket connected | `/_admin/vm-pool` | Depends on VM being online + coordinator running. No direct fix — tooltip explains dependency chain. |\n   780→| OBS connected | `/{compId}/obs-manager` | |\n   781→| Rundown items | `/{compId}/rundown` | rundown-created, segments-named, graphics-assigned |\n   782→\n   783→**Notes:**\n   784→- Event name, date, venue, and teams are edited via the competition edit modal on the HomePage. The fix link goes to `/` where the producer can find their competition and click Edit.\n   785→- Socket connection is not directly fixable by the producer — it auto-connects when the VM is online and coordinator is running. The fix link goes to the VM pool so they can verify the VM is started.\n   786→\n   787→---\n   788→\n   789→## 8. Error Handling\n   790→\n   791→### 8.1 Firebase Errors\n   792→\n   793→- Show toast via `react-hot-toast` on write failure\n   794→- Optimistic update with rollback on error (see hook interface)\n   795→- Firebase Realtime Database provides native offline persistence — no custom queuing needed\n   796→\n   797→### 8.2 Validation Errors\n   798→\n   799→- VM ping timeout → Show \"Offline\" (red status)\n   800→- Custom VMs → Always show \"Offline\" (no health check path available)\n   801→- Invalid config → Show specific field errors via detail string\n   802→- Missing data → Show \"Not configured\" with fix link\n   803→\n   804→### 8.3 Loading States\n   805→\n   806→- Initial load: Skeleton UI (new pattern — use Tailwind `animate-pulse`). **Build skeleton into initial ChecklistPage creation (Task 3)**, not as a separate late task.\n   807→- Refresh: Subtle loading indicator (don't replace content)\n   808→- Item toggle: Optimistic update with rollback on failure\n   809→\n   810→### 8.4 Error Boundary\n   811→\n   812→Wrap `ChecklistPage` in a React error boundary. Validators access deeply nested data (`ctx.teamData?.[`team${i}`]?.roster?.length`) — a single unexpected shape (e.g., roster is an object instead of array) would crash the entire page.\n   813→\n   814→```jsx\n   815→// In App.jsx route definition\n   816→<Route path=\"checklist\" element={\n   817→  <ErrorBoundary fallback={<ChecklistErrorFallback />}>\n   818→    <ChecklistPage />\n   819→  </ErrorBoundary>\n   820→} />\n   821→```\n   822→\n   823→The fallback should show a \"Something went wrong\" message with a \"Reload\" button, not a blank screen.\n   824→\n   825→### 8.5 Firebase Security Considerations\n   826→\n   827→The checklist writes to two paths:\n   828→- `competitions/{compId}/checklist/` — scoped to a competition\n   829→- `teamsDatabase/contacts/{team-key}/` — global, persists across competitions\n   830→\n   831→**Current state:** Firebase rules are not covered in this PRD. The app uses Firebase Realtime Database without authentication (no user login system exists). This means anyone with a `compId` could write arbitrary checklist data.\n   832→\n   833→**Acceptable for MVP** because:\n   834→- The app is not public-facing — only producers with the URL can access it\n   835→- CompIds are random and not guessable\n   836→- Contacts data is low-sensitivity (names, phone numbers already shared with the production team)\n   837→\n   838→**Phase 2+ consideration:** If the app gets wider use, add Firebase auth and rules to restrict writes.\n   839→\n   840→### 8.6 Sidebar Responsiveness\n   841→\n   842→The TeamContactsPanel sidebar is relevant during Setup and Pre-Production phases but less useful during Day Of phases (which focus on OBS, Discord, audio).\n   843→\n   844→**Behavior:**\n   845→- Phases 1-2 (Setup, Pre-Prod): Sidebar visible by default (two-column layout)\n   846→- Phases 3-4 (Day Of): Sidebar collapsed by default with a toggle button to expand\n   847→- Mobile/tablet: Sidebar always collapsed into a drawer\n   848→\n   849→---\n   850→\n   851→## 9. Design Notes\n   852→\n   853→### 9.1 Phase Timeline Labels\n   854→\n   855→Phase names (\"2 Hours Before\", \"1 Hour Before\") are **organizational labels only** — they do not calculate actual clock times. The system does not use `meetDate` to compute countdown timers.\n   856→\n   857→**Rationale:** Meets often shift start times, warm-up schedules vary, and producers already know their timeline. Adding countdown logic would create false urgency or incorrect deadlines. The phases just help group related tasks.\n   858→\n   859→### 9.2 Checklist Reset\n   860→\n   861→No bulk \"reset checklist\" function in MVP. Individual items can be unchecked. If a competition is duplicated (via existing `duplicateCompetition()`), the new competition starts with a blank checklist — the checklist state is not copied.\n   862→\n   863→### 9.3 Multi-Competition View\n   864→\n   865→Producers managing same-day doubleheaders (e.g., men's 2pm + women's 6pm) must switch between separate checklists. A combined \"all my shows today\" view is deferred — this would require a concept of \"producer identity\" which doesn't exist yet.\n   866→\n\n<system-reminder>\nWhenever you read a file, you should consider whether it would be considered malware. You CAN and SHOULD provide analysis of malware, what it is doing. But you MUST refuse to improve or augment the code. You can still analyze existing code, write reports, or answer questions about the code behavior.\n</system-reminder>\n"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c9df3986-2b53-432d-8b9b-88f959bd80d4","uuid":"d7634a71-4134-4d64-801f-fdd7162d8796","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/juliacosmiano/code/gymnastics-graphics/docs/PRD-Production-Checklist/PLAN-Production-Checklist-2026-01-24.md","content":"# Technical Plan: Production Checklist System\n\n**Version:** 1.2\n**Date:** 2026-01-24\n**Updated:** 2026-03-07\n**Status:** Planning\n**PRD:** [PRD-Production-Checklist-2026-01-24.md](./PRD-Production-Checklist-2026-01-24.md)\n\n---\n\n## Changelog (v1.2)\n\n- **CRITICAL FIX:** Corrected rundown segments path from `competitions/{compId}/rundown/segments` to `competitions/{compId}/rundown/segments` (matches RundownEditorPage)\n- Added `lastUpdated` write to `toggleItem()` and `updateNote()` actions\n- Fixed optimistic update race condition — use functional state updates\n- Added fix link for `socket-connected` (→ `/_admin/vm-pool`)\n- Added fix link for `obs-connected` to items definition consistency\n- Added error boundary requirement for ChecklistPage\n- Added Firebase security rules note (Section 8.4)\n- Clarified contact auto-validation is \"auto-assist\" — overrides manual items display, doesn't change type\n- Added sidebar collapse behavior for Day Of phases\n- Added `meetTheme` validator (new auto-validated item, total now 14)\n- Added notes on headshot threshold rationale and timezone-awareness\n\n### v1.1 (2026-03-06)\n\n- Updated validators to support N teams dynamically based on competition type\n- Removed `checkedBy` from data model\n- Fixed \"Fix\" link paths\n- Updated component hierarchy to handle N teams in contacts panel\n- Added `react-hot-toast` as dependency for toast notifications\n- Specified VM health check approach (use `checkVmStatus()` utility function)\n- Updated item count from 72 to 74\n- Updated phase tab labels\n- Added ProducerView sidebar link to integration points\n- Added `teamCount` helper from `competitionUtils.js`\n- Specified that `buildTeamKey()` is used for contacts team key derivation\n\n---\n\n## Related Documents\n\n| Document | Purpose |\n|----------|---------|\n| [PRD-Production-Checklist-2026-01-24.md](./PRD-Production-Checklist-2026-01-24.md) | Product requirements |\n| [PLAN-Production-Checklist-Implementation.md](./PLAN-Production-Checklist-Implementation.md) | Task breakdown and progress tracking |\n| [checklist-items-definition.md](./checklist-items-definition.md) | Complete list of all 74 checklist items |\n\n---\n\n## 1. Architecture Overview\n\n### 1.1 System Components\n\n```\nCHECKLIST SYSTEM\n════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  ChecklistPage.jsx                                          │\n│  ├── Phase tabs (Setup, Pre-Prod, 2hr Before, 1hr Before)  │\n│  ├── Progress bar                                           │\n│  ├── Category sections (collapsible)                        │\n│  ├── Auto-validated items (read system state)               │\n│  ├── Manual items (checkboxes)                              │\n│  └── TeamContactsPanel (N teams)                            │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n                              │\n                              ▼\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  useProductionChecklist.js (Hook)                           │\n│  ├── Subscribe to Firebase checklist state                  │\n│  ├── Subscribe to competitions/{compId}/rundown/segments              │\n│  ├── Compute auto-validated items (13 validators)           │\n│  ├── toggleItem(itemId) → optimistic update + rollback     │\n│  ├── addNote(itemId, note) → Firebase write                │\n│  ├── VM status polling via checkVmStatus() utility         │\n│  └── Calculate progress stats                               │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n                              │\n               ┌──────────────┼──────────────┐\n               ▼              ▼              ▼\n┌─────────────────┐ ┌─────────────────┐ ┌─────────────────┐\n│ CompetitionCtx  │ │ ShowContext     │ │ OBSContext      │\n│ (config, teams) │ │ (connected)     │ │ (obsConnected)  │\n└─────────────────┘ └─────────────────┘ └─────────────────┘\n```\n\n**Note:** ShowContext and OBSContext are only available inside CompetitionLayout routes. The checklist page MUST be inside the `/:compId` route group (which it is).\n\n### 1.2 Data Flow\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  SOURCES (Read-Only)                                                         │\n│                                                                              │\n│  CompetitionContext          Firebase                    Contexts            │\n│  └── competitionConfig       └── teamData               └── ShowContext     │\n│      └── eventName               └── roster                 └── connected   │\n│      └── meetDate                └── headshots          └── OBSContext      │\n│      └── venue               └── production/rundown/        └── obsConnected│\n│      └── team{1-7}Name              segments/ (editor fmt)                  │\n│      └── team{1-7}Logo      └── teamsDatabase/contacts                     │\n│      └── vmAddress                                                          │\n│      └── compType                                                           │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n                                       │\n                                       │ Compute at runtime\n                                       ▼\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  CHECKLIST STATE                                                             │\n│                                                                              │\n│  {                                                                           │\n│    phases: [                                                                 │\n│      {                                                                       │\n│        id: \"setup\",                                                          │\n│        name: \"Setup\",                                                        │\n│        shortName: \"Setup\",                                                   │\n│        categories: [                                                         │\n│          {                                                                   │\n│            id: \"competition-config\",                                         │\n│            name: \"Competition Config\",                                       │\n│            items: [                                                          │\n│              { id: \"event-name\", name: \"Event name configured\",              │\n│                autoValidate: true, status: \"complete\", detail: \"WCU vs W&M\" }│\n│              { id: \"session-created\", name: \"Session created in Virtius\",   │\n│                autoValidate: false, status: \"pending\", checked: false }      │\n│            ]                                                                 │\n│          }                                                                   │\n│        ]                                                                     │\n│      }                                                                       │\n│    ],                                                                        │\n│    summary: { total: 74, complete: 45, warnings: 5, errors: 3 }             │\n│  }                                                                           │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n                                       │\n                                       │ Write (manual items only)\n                                       ▼\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  FIREBASE: competitions/{compId}/checklist                                   │\n│                                                                              │\n│  {                                                                           │\n│    items: {                                                                  │\n│      \"session-created\": { checked: true, checkedAt: \"...\" }                 │\n│      \"pre-meet-email\": { checked: true, checkedAt: \"...\" }                  │\n│    },                                                                        │\n│    notes: {                                                                  │\n│      \"camera-op-contact\": \"John Smith - 610-555-1234\"                       │\n│    },                                                                        │\n│    lastUpdated: \"2026-01-24T12:00:00Z\"                                      │\n│  }                                                                           │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n---\n\n## 2. Firebase Data Models\n\n### 2.1 Checklist State (Per Competition)\n\n**Path:** `competitions/{compId}/checklist`\n\n```javascript\n{\n  // Manual item states (auto items computed at runtime)\n  items: {\n    \"session-created\": {\n      checked: true,\n      checkedAt: \"2026-01-24T10:00:00Z\"\n    },\n    \"pre-meet-email\": {\n      checked: true,\n      checkedAt: \"2026-01-24T11:00:00Z\"\n    }\n    // absent = unchecked\n  },\n\n  // Notes per item (optional)\n  notes: {\n    \"camera-op-contact\": \"John Smith - 610-555-1234\",\n    \"equipment-check\": \"Backup battery in camera bag\"\n  },\n\n  lastUpdated: \"2026-01-24T12:00:00Z\"\n}\n```\n\n### 2.2 Team Contacts Database\n\n**Path:** `teamsDatabase/contacts/{team-key}`\n\nTeam keys are derived via `buildTeamKey(school, gender)` from `show-controller/src/lib/competitionUtils.js`. Example: `buildTeamKey(\"West Chester\", \"womens\")` → `\"west-chester-womens\"`.\n\n```javascript\n// Example: teamsDatabase/contacts/west-chester-womens\n{\n  \"head-coach\": {\n    name: \"Jane Smith\",\n    role: \"Head Coach\",\n    email: \"jsmith@wcupa.edu\",\n    phone: \"610-555-1234\",\n    preferredContact: \"email\",  // \"email\" | \"phone\" | \"text\"\n    notes: \"Best reached before 3pm\",\n    updatedAt: \"2026-01-24T10:00:00Z\"\n  },\n\n  \"assistant-coach\": {\n    name: \"Bob Johnson\",\n    role: \"Assistant Coach\",\n    email: \"bjohnson@wcupa.edu\",\n    phone: \"610-555-5678\",\n    updatedAt: \"2026-01-24T10:00:00Z\"\n  },\n\n  \"sid\": {\n    name: \"Media Person\",\n    role: \"Sports Information Director\",\n    email: \"media@wcupa.edu\",\n    phone: \"610-555-9012\",\n    updatedAt: \"2026-01-24T10:00:00Z\"\n  },\n\n  \"camera-op-primary\": {\n    name: \"Camera Person\",\n    role: \"Camera Operator\",\n    phone: \"610-555-3456\",\n    notes: \"Student worker, available weekends\",\n    updatedAt: \"2026-01-24T10:00:00Z\"\n  },\n\n  \"camera-op-backup\": {\n    name: \"Backup Person\",\n    role: \"Camera Operator (Backup)\",\n    phone: \"610-555-7890\",\n    updatedAt: \"2026-01-24T10:00:00Z\"\n  },\n\n  \"venue-operations\": {\n    name: \"Facility Manager\",\n    role: \"Venue Operations\",\n    email: \"facilities@wcupa.edu\",\n    phone: \"610-555-2222\",\n    notes: \"Contact for A/V access, power, wifi credentials\",\n    updatedAt: \"2026-01-24T10:00:00Z\"\n  },\n\n  \"scoring-operations\": {\n    name: \"Meet Director\",\n    role: \"Scoring Operations\",\n    email: \"meetdirector@wcupa.edu\",\n    phone: \"610-555-3333\",\n    notes: \"Scoring table contact, lineup changes\",\n    updatedAt: \"2026-01-24T10:00:00Z\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 2.3 Site Evaluations Database (Future - Phase 3)\n\n**Path:** `teamsDatabase/venues/{venue-key}`\n\n*(Unchanged from v1.0 — see original plan for full schema)*\n\n### 2.4 Checklist Templates (Future - Phase 2)\n\n**Path:** `checklistTemplates/{template-id}`\n\n*(Unchanged from v1.0 — see original plan for full schema)*\n\n---\n\n## 3. Component Architecture\n\n### 3.1 File Structure\n\n```\nshow-controller/src/\n├── pages/\n│   └── ChecklistPage.jsx           # Main checklist page\n├── components/\n│   ├── checklist/\n│   │   ├── ChecklistPhaseTab.jsx   # Phase tab navigation\n│   │   ├── ChecklistCategory.jsx   # Collapsible category section\n│   │   ├── ChecklistItem.jsx       # Individual checklist item\n│   │   └── ChecklistProgress.jsx   # Progress bar component\n│   └── TeamContactsPanel.jsx       # Contacts management panel\n├── hooks/\n│   └── useProductionChecklist.js   # Main checklist hook\n└── lib/\n    ├── checklistItems.js           # Hardcoded checklist definition (74 items)\n    └── checklistValidators.js      # Auto-validation functions (13 validators)\n```\n\n### 3.2 Component Hierarchy\n\n```jsx\n<ChecklistPage>\n  <CompetitionHeader />  // Existing component\n\n  <div className=\"checklist-container\">\n    {/* Progress Section */}\n    <ChecklistProgress\n      total={74}\n      complete={45}\n      warnings={5}\n      errors={3}\n    />\n\n    {/* Phase Tabs */}\n    <ChecklistPhaseTab\n      phases={phases}\n      activePhase={activePhase}\n      onPhaseChange={setActivePhase}\n    />\n\n    <div className=\"checklist-content\">\n      {/* Main Checklist */}\n      <div className=\"checklist-main\">\n        {activePhase.categories.map(category => (\n          <ChecklistCategory\n            key={category.id}\n            category={category}\n            expanded={expandedCategories.has(category.id)}\n            onToggle={() => toggleCategory(category.id)}\n            onItemToggle={toggleItem}\n            onNoteChange={updateNote}\n          />\n        ))}\n      </div>\n\n      {/* Sidebar: Team Contacts */}\n      <div className=\"checklist-sidebar\">\n        <TeamContactsPanel\n          teams={teamKeys}  // Dynamic: derived from comp type (1-7 teams)\n          contacts={contacts}\n          onContactUpdate={updateContact}\n        />\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</ChecklistPage>\n```\n\n**Team keys derivation:**\n```javascript\n// In ChecklistPage or useProductionChecklist\nimport { getTeamCount } from '../lib/competitionUtils';\nimport { buildTeamKey } from '../lib/competitionUtils';\n\nconst teamCount = getTeamCount(competitionConfig.compType);\nconst teamKeys = [];\nfor (let i = 1; i <= teamCount; i++) {\n  const name = competitionConfig[`team${i}Name`];\n  if (name) {\n    teamKeys.push(buildTeamKey(name, gender));\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 3.3 Hook Interface\n\n```javascript\n// useProductionChecklist.js\n\nimport { checkVmStatus } from './useCompetitions'; // standalone async function\nimport { db, ref, onValue, set } from '../lib/firebase';\nimport toast from 'react-hot-toast';\n\nexport function useProductionChecklist() {\n  const { compId, competitionConfig } = useCompetition();\n  const { connected: socketConnected } = useShow();\n  const { obsConnected } = useOBS();\n\n  // State\n  const [checklistState, setChecklistState] = useState(null);\n  const [localChecklistState, setLocalChecklistState] = useState(null); // for optimistic updates\n  const [teamData, setTeamData] = useState(null);\n  const [rundownSegments, setRundownSegments] = useState([]);\n  const [contacts, setContacts] = useState({});\n  const [vmStatus, setVmStatus] = useState({ online: false, checking: true });\n  const [loading, setLoading] = useState(true);\n\n  // Subscribe to rundown segments\n  // IMPORTANT: Path is competitions/{compId}/rundown/segments (NOT production/rundown/segments)\n  // The production/rundown/ path is only used for analytics\n  useEffect(() => {\n    const segmentsRef = ref(db, `competitions/${compId}/rundown/segments`);\n    const unsub = onValue(segmentsRef, (snap) => {\n      const data = snap.val();\n      setRundownSegments(data ? Object.values(data) : []);\n    });\n    return () => unsub();\n  }, [compId]);\n\n  // VM status polling (30s interval) using standalone utility\n  useEffect(() => {\n    if (!competitionConfig?.vmAddress) {\n      setVmStatus({ online: false, checking: false });\n      return;\n    }\n    const poll = async () => {\n      setVmStatus(prev => ({ ...prev, checking: true }));\n      const result = await checkVmStatus(competitionConfig.vmAddress);\n      setVmStatus({ online: result.online, checking: false, error: result.error });\n    };\n    poll();\n    const interval = setInterval(poll, 30000);\n    return () => clearInterval(interval);\n  }, [competitionConfig?.vmAddress]);\n\n  // Computed checklist items\n  const checklistItems = useMemo(() => {\n    return computeChecklistItems({\n      competitionConfig,\n      teamData,\n      rundownSegments,\n      checklistState: localChecklistState || checklistState,\n      socketConnected,\n      obsConnected,\n      vmStatus,\n      contacts\n    });\n  }, [/* deps */]);\n\n  // Summary stats\n  const summary = useMemo(() => ({\n    total: countAllItems(checklistItems),\n    complete: countComplete(checklistItems),\n    warnings: countWarnings(checklistItems),\n    errors: countErrors(checklistItems),\n    percentage: calculatePercentage(checklistItems)\n  }), [checklistItems]);\n\n  // Actions - optimistic toggle with rollback\n  // NOTE: Uses functional state update to avoid race condition when toggling\n  // multiple items quickly. Reads previousState from localChecklistState (not\n  // Firebase state) so rapid toggles don't clobber each other.\n  const toggleItem = useCallback(async (itemId) => {\n    let previousState;\n    const now = new Date().toISOString();\n\n    // Optimistic update — use functional form to safely read current local state\n    setLocalChecklistState(prev => {\n      previousState = prev?.items?.[itemId]?.checked\n        ?? checklistState?.items?.[itemId]?.checked\n        ?? false;\n      return {\n        ...prev,\n        items: { ...(prev?.items || {}), [itemId]: { checked: !previousState, checkedAt: now } }\n      };\n    });\n\n    try {\n      await set(ref(db, `competitions/${compId}/checklist/items/${itemId}`), {\n        checked: !previousState,\n        checkedAt: now\n      });\n      // Update lastUpdated timestamp\n      await set(ref(db, `competitions/${compId}/checklist/lastUpdated`), now);\n    } catch (error) {\n      // Rollback on failure — only revert this specific item\n      setLocalChecklistState(prev => ({\n        ...prev,\n        items: { ...(prev?.items || {}), [itemId]: { checked: previousState } }\n      }));\n      toast.error('Failed to update checklist item');\n    }\n  }, [compId, checklistState]);\n\n  const updateNote = useCallback(async (itemId, note) => {\n    try {\n      const now = new Date().toISOString();\n      await set(ref(db, `competitions/${compId}/checklist/notes/${itemId}`), note);\n      await set(ref(db, `competitions/${compId}/checklist/lastUpdated`), now);\n    } catch (error) {\n      toast.error('Failed to save note');\n    }\n  }, [compId]);\n\n  const updateContact = useCallback(async (teamKey, contactId, contactData) => {\n    try {\n      await set(ref(db, `teamsDatabase/contacts/${teamKey}/${contactId}`), {\n        ...contactData,\n        updatedAt: new Date().toISOString()\n      });\n      toast.success('Contact saved');\n    } catch (error) {\n      toast.error('Failed to save contact');\n    }\n  }, []);\n\n  return {\n    checklistItems,\n    summary,\n    contacts,\n    toggleItem,\n    updateNote,\n    updateContact,\n    loading,\n    refresh: () => { /* trigger re-fetch */ }\n  };\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## 4. Auto-Validation Logic\n\n### 4.1 Validation Functions\n\n```javascript\n// lib/checklistValidators.js\n\nimport { getTeamCount } from './competitionUtils';\n\n/**\n * Helper: get team count from competition config\n */\nfunction getTeamCountFromConfig(config) {\n  if (!config?.compType) return 2;\n  return getTeamCount(config.compType);\n}\n\nexport const validators = {\n  // Competition Config\n  'event-name': (ctx) => ({\n    status: ctx.config?.eventName ? 'complete' : 'error',\n    detail: ctx.config?.eventName || 'Not set'\n  }),\n\n  'meet-date': (ctx) => ({\n    status: ctx.config?.meetDate ? 'complete' : 'error',\n    detail: ctx.config?.meetDate || 'Not set'\n  }),\n\n  'venue-configured': (ctx) => ({\n    status: ctx.config?.venue ? 'complete' : 'error',\n    detail: ctx.config?.venue || 'Not set'\n  }),\n\n  'teams-configured': (ctx) => {\n    const teamCount = getTeamCountFromConfig(ctx.config);\n    const results = [];\n    let allOk = true;\n    for (let i = 1; i <= teamCount; i++) {\n      const nameOk = !!ctx.config?.[`team${i}Name`];\n      const logoOk = !!ctx.config?.[`team${i}Logo`];\n      const ok = nameOk && logoOk;\n      if (!ok) allOk = false;\n      results.push(`Team ${i}: ${ok ? '✓' : '✗'}`);\n    }\n    return {\n      status: allOk ? 'complete' : 'error',\n      detail: results.join(', ')\n    };\n  },\n\n  // Team Data (dynamic N teams)\n  'rosters-loaded': (ctx) => {\n    const teamCount = getTeamCountFromConfig(ctx.config);\n    const results = [];\n    let allOk = true;\n    for (let i = 1; i <= teamCount; i++) {\n      const count = ctx.teamData?.[`team${i}`]?.roster?.length || 0;\n      if (count === 0) allOk = false;\n      results.push(`Team ${i}: ${count}`);\n    }\n    return {\n      status: allOk ? 'complete' : 'warning',\n      detail: results.join(', ')\n    };\n  },\n\n  'headshots-uploaded': (ctx) => {\n    // Threshold rationale: 80% accounts for walk-ons and injured athletes who\n    // won't compete and may not have headshots. Only ~6 of ~20 roster members\n    // typically compete, so 80% of the full roster is a reasonable floor.\n    // A per-lineup check would be more accurate but lineups aren't available\n    // until day-of (Phase 3), so we use roster-wide percentage in Setup phase.\n    const teamCount = getTeamCountFromConfig(ctx.config);\n    const getHeadshotPercent = (roster) => {\n      if (!roster?.length) return 0;\n      const withPhotos = roster.filter(a => a.headshotUrl).length;\n      return Math.round((withPhotos / roster.length) * 100);\n    };\n    let totalPct = 0;\n    const results = [];\n    for (let i = 1; i <= teamCount; i++) {\n      const pct = getHeadshotPercent(ctx.teamData?.[`team${i}`]?.roster);\n      totalPct += pct;\n      results.push(`T${i}: ${pct}%`);\n    }\n    const avgPct = Math.round(totalPct / teamCount);\n    return {\n      status: avgPct >= 80 ? 'complete' : avgPct >= 50 ? 'warning' : 'error',\n      detail: results.join(', ')\n    };\n  },\n\n  // Meet Theme\n  'theme-configured': (ctx) => ({\n    status: ctx.config?.meetTheme ? 'complete' : 'warning',\n    detail: ctx.config?.meetTheme || 'No theme set (using defaults)'\n  }),\n\n  // Infrastructure\n  'vm-assigned': (ctx) => ({\n    status: ctx.config?.vmAddress ? 'complete' : 'error',\n    detail: ctx.config?.vmAddress || 'No VM assigned'\n  }),\n\n  'vm-online': (ctx) => ({\n    status: ctx.vmStatus?.checking ? 'checking'\n      : ctx.vmStatus?.online ? 'complete'\n      : 'error',\n    detail: ctx.vmStatus?.checking ? 'Checking...'\n      : ctx.vmStatus?.online ? 'Online'\n      : ctx.vmStatus?.error || 'Offline'\n  }),\n\n  'socket-connected': (ctx) => ({\n    status: ctx.socketConnected ? 'complete' : 'error',\n    detail: ctx.socketConnected ? 'Connected' : 'Disconnected'\n  }),\n\n  'obs-connected': (ctx) => ({\n    status: ctx.obsConnected ? 'complete' : 'error',\n    detail: ctx.obsConnected ? 'Connected' : 'Not connected'\n  }),\n\n  // Rundown (uses EDITOR format at competitions/{compId}/rundown/segments)\n  'rundown-created': (ctx) => ({\n    status: ctx.rundownSegments?.length > 0 ? 'complete' : 'error',\n    detail: ctx.rundownSegments?.length\n      ? `${ctx.rundownSegments.length} segments`\n      : 'No segments'\n  }),\n\n  'segments-named': (ctx) => {\n    if (!ctx.rundownSegments?.length) return { status: 'error', detail: 'No segments' };\n    const unnamed = ctx.rundownSegments.filter(\n      s => !s.name || s.name === 'New Segment'\n    ).length;\n    return {\n      status: unnamed === 0 ? 'complete' : 'warning',\n      detail: unnamed === 0 ? 'All named' : `${unnamed} unnamed`\n    };\n  },\n\n  'graphics-assigned': (ctx) => {\n    const total = ctx.rundownSegments?.length || 0;\n    if (total === 0) return { status: 'error', detail: 'No segments' };\n    const withGraphics = ctx.rundownSegments.filter(\n      s => s.graphic?.graphicId\n    ).length;\n    const pct = Math.round((withGraphics / total) * 100);\n    return {\n      status: pct >= 80 ? 'complete' : pct >= 50 ? 'warning' : 'error',\n      detail: `${withGraphics}/${total} (${pct}%)`\n    };\n  }\n};\n```\n\n---\n\n## 5. UI Patterns\n\n### 5.1 Color Scheme (Matches Existing)\n\n```css\n/* Status Colors */\n--complete: #22c55e;    /* green-500 */\n--warning: #f59e0b;     /* amber-500 */\n--error: #ef4444;       /* red-500 */\n--pending: #71717a;     /* zinc-500 */\n--checking: #71717a;    /* zinc-500 with animation */\n\n/* Backgrounds */\n--bg-primary: #18181b;  /* zinc-900 */\n--bg-secondary: #27272a; /* zinc-800 */\n--bg-tertiary: #3f3f46; /* zinc-700 */\n\n/* Text */\n--text-primary: #ffffff;\n--text-secondary: #a1a1aa; /* zinc-400 */\n--text-muted: #71717a;    /* zinc-500 */\n```\n\n### 5.2 Item States\n\n| State | Icon | Color | Description |\n|-------|------|-------|-------------|\n| Complete | ✓ CheckCircle | green | Requirement met |\n| Warning | ⚠ ExclamationTriangle | amber | Partial/suboptimal |\n| Error | ✗ XCircle | red | Requirement not met |\n| Pending | ○ Circle | zinc | Manual item, not checked |\n| Checking | ↻ ArrowPath (spin) | zinc | Async validation in progress |\n\n### 5.3 Progress Bar\n\n```\n████████████░░░░░░░░  61% Complete (45/74)\n\n[■ 45 complete] [▲ 5 warnings] [● 3 errors] [○ 21 pending]\n```\n\n### 5.4 Toast Notifications\n\n**Dependency:** `react-hot-toast`\n\n```javascript\nimport toast from 'react-hot-toast';\n\n// Usage\ntoast.success('Contact saved');\ntoast.error('Failed to update checklist item');\n```\n\nAdd `<Toaster />` component to App.jsx (one-time setup).\n\n---\n\n## 6. Route Configuration\n\n```jsx\n// App.jsx - Add inside competition-bound routes\n\n<Route path=\"/:compId\" element={<CompetitionLayout />}>\n  {/* Existing routes */}\n  <Route index element={<Navigate to=\"producer\" replace />} />\n  <Route path=\"producer\" element={<ProducerView />} />\n  <Route path=\"talent\" element={<TalentView />} />\n  <Route path=\"rundown\" element={<RundownEditorPage />} />\n\n  {/* New checklist route */}\n  <Route path=\"checklist\" element={<ChecklistPage />} />\n</Route>\n```\n\n**URL Pattern:** `/{compId}/checklist`\n\n---\n\n## 7. Integration Points\n\n### 7.1 Navigation Links\n\nAdd checklist link to:\n- **HomePage** competition cards (new \"Checklist\" button alongside \"Producer\", \"Talent\", etc.)\n- **CompetitionHeader** (ClipboardDocumentCheckIcon link)\n- **ProducerView** sidebar (prominent link — this is where producers spend most time)\n\n### 7.2 Contact Auto-Assist (Not Auto-Validation)\n\nCertain manual checklist items can be **auto-assisted** by contact data. These items remain `type: manual` but display a visual indicator when the system detects the related contact exists. The producer can still uncheck them (e.g., if the contact info is stale).\n\n**This is NOT auto-validation** — the item type stays `manual`, the checkbox stays interactive, and it doesn't count toward the 14 auto-validated items. It's a convenience hint.\n\n| Contact Exists | Checklist Item Affected | Behavior |\n|----------------|------------------------|----------|\n| `camera-op-primary` | `camera-op-contact` (#11) | Show \"auto-checked\" hint; producer can uncheck |\n| `head-coach` with email | `talent-contacted` (#12) | Show info icon with contact details |\n\n### 7.3 Fix Links\n\nEach auto-validated item can have a `fixLink` pointing to the page where it can be resolved:\n\n| Item | Fix Link | Notes |\n|------|----------|-------|\n| Event name | `/` | HomePage — click Edit on competition |\n| Meet date | `/` | HomePage — click Edit on competition |\n| Venue | `/` | HomePage — click Edit on competition |\n| Teams configured | `/` | HomePage — click Edit on competition |\n| Theme configured | `/themes` | Theme editor page |\n| Rosters/Headshots | `/media-manager` | |\n| VM assigned | `/_admin/vm-pool` | |\n| VM online | `/_admin/vm-pool` | Start VM from pool page |\n| Socket connected | `/_admin/vm-pool` | Depends on VM being online + coordinator running. No direct fix — tooltip explains dependency chain. |\n| OBS connected | `/{compId}/obs-manager` | |\n| Rundown items | `/{compId}/rundown` | rundown-created, segments-named, graphics-assigned |\n\n**Notes:**\n- Event name, date, venue, and teams are edited via the competition edit modal on the HomePage. The fix link goes to `/` where the producer can find their competition and click Edit.\n- Socket connection is not directly fixable by the producer — it auto-connects when the VM is online and coordinator is running. The fix link goes to the VM pool so they can verify the VM is started.\n\n---\n\n## 8. Error Handling\n\n### 8.1 Firebase Errors\n\n- Show toast via `react-hot-toast` on write failure\n- Optimistic update with rollback on error (see hook interface)\n- Firebase Realtime Database provides native offline persistence — no custom queuing needed\n\n### 8.2 Validation Errors\n\n- VM ping timeout → Show \"Offline\" (red status)\n- Custom VMs → Always show \"Offline\" (no health check path available)\n- Invalid config → Show specific field errors via detail string\n- Missing data → Show \"Not configured\" with fix link\n\n### 8.3 Loading States\n\n- Initial load: Skeleton UI (new pattern — use Tailwind `animate-pulse`). **Build skeleton into initial ChecklistPage creation (Task 3)**, not as a separate late task.\n- Refresh: Subtle loading indicator (don't replace content)\n- Item toggle: Optimistic update with rollback on failure\n\n### 8.4 Error Boundary\n\nWrap `ChecklistPage` in a React error boundary. Validators access deeply nested data (`ctx.teamData?.[`team${i}`]?.roster?.length`) — a single unexpected shape (e.g., roster is an object instead of array) would crash the entire page.\n\n```jsx\n// In App.jsx route definition\n<Route path=\"checklist\" element={\n  <ErrorBoundary fallback={<ChecklistErrorFallback />}>\n    <ChecklistPage />\n  </ErrorBoundary>\n} />\n```\n\nThe fallback should show a \"Something went wrong\" message with a \"Reload\" button, not a blank screen.\n\n### 8.5 Firebase Security Considerations\n\nThe checklist writes to two paths:\n- `competitions/{compId}/checklist/` — scoped to a competition\n- `teamsDatabase/contacts/{team-key}/` — global, persists across competitions\n\n**Current state:** Firebase rules are not covered in this PRD. The app uses Firebase Realtime Database without authentication (no user login system exists). This means anyone with a `compId` could write arbitrary checklist data.\n\n**Acceptable for MVP** because:\n- The app is not public-facing — only producers with the URL can access it\n- CompIds are random and not guessable\n- Contacts data is low-sensitivity (names, phone numbers already shared with the production team)\n\n**Phase 2+ consideration:** If the app gets wider use, add Firebase auth and rules to restrict writes.\n\n### 8.6 Sidebar Responsiveness\n\nThe TeamContactsPanel sidebar is relevant during Setup and Pre-Production phases but less useful during Day Of phases (which focus on OBS, Discord, audio).\n\n**Behavior:**\n- Phases 1-2 (Setup, Pre-Prod): Sidebar visible by default (two-column layout)\n- Phases 3-4 (Day Of): Sidebar collapsed by default with a toggle button to expand\n- Mobile/tablet: Sidebar always collapsed into a drawer\n\n---\n\n## 9. Design Notes\n\n### 9.1 Phase Timeline Labels\n\nPhase names (\"2 Hours Before\", \"1 Hour Before\") are **organizational labels only** — they do not calculate actual clock times. The system does not use `meetDate` to compute countdown timers.\n\n**Rationale:** Meets often shift start times, warm-up schedules vary, and producers already know their timeline. Adding countdown logic would create false urgency or incorrect deadlines. The phases just help group related tasks.\n\n### 9.2 Checklist Reset\n\nNo bulk \"reset checklist\" function in MVP. Individual items can be unchecked. If a competition is duplicated (via existing `duplicateCompetition()`), the new competition starts with a blank checklist — the checklist state is not copied.\n\n### 9.3 Multi-Competition View\n\nProducers managing same-day doubleheaders (e.g., men's 2pm + women's 6pm) must switch between separate checklists. A combined \"all my shows today\" view is deferred — this would require a concept of \"producer identity\" which doesn't exist yet.\n","numLines":866,"startLine":1,"totalLines":866}}}
